# Infrastructure Rules (A2)

Load and follow `skills/safety/infra.md` (canonical SSoT) when working on infrastructure, deployment, or environment files.

Fail-closed bootstrap guard: if the canonical file cannot be read, treat infrastructure, deployment, and environment changes as high-impact — do not apply them without explicit user approval, and prefer render, dry-run, or read-only verification.
